### Hermes Fase 12 — Demo Flow HTTP
### Compatible con IntelliJ HTTP Client / VS Code REST Client
### Ajusta nombres de campos al DTO exacto de tu implementación.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@accessToken = REPLACE_ME
@organizationId = REPLACE_ME
@saleId = REPLACE_ME
@documentId = REPLACE_ME
@signatureId = REPLACE_ME
@sequenceId = REPLACE_ME
@homologationRunId = REPLACE_ME

### Common headers
# Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
# X-Hermes-Organization-Id: {{organizationId}}

### 1) Consultar settings SRI
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sri/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Hermes-Organization-Id: {{organizationId}}


### 2) Actualizar settings SRI TEST
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sri/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Hermes-Organization-Id: {{organizationId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "environmentMode": "TEST",
  "issuerRuc": "1790012345001",
  "legalName": "HERMES DEMO S.A.",
  "commercialName": "Hermes Demo",
  "matrixAddress": "Dirección matriz demo",
  "establishmentCode": "001",
  "emissionPointCode": "001",
  "branchAddress": "Dirección sucursal demo",
  "obligedToKeepAccounting": false,
  "specialTaxpayerNumber": null,
  "rimpeLegend": null,
  "agentRetentionResolution": null,
  "defaultCurrency": "DOLAR",
  "invoiceSchemaVersion": "2.1.0",
  "emailSenderName": "Hermes Demo",
  "emailReplyTo": "facturacion@example.com",
  "testReceptionWsdlUrl": "https://example.test/reception?wsdl",
  "testAuthorizationWsdlUrl": "https://example.test/authorization?wsdl",
  "productionReceptionWsdlUrl": "https://example.prod/reception?wsdl",
  "productionAuthorizationWsdlUrl": "https://example.prod/authorization?wsdl"
}


### 3) Readiness antes/después de firma y secuencia
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sri/settings/readiness
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Hermes-Organization-Id: {{organizationId}}


### 4) Cargar firma electrónica
### Ajustar si tu endpoint usa multipart/form-data en lugar de JSON/base64.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/electronic-signatures
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Hermes-Organization-Id: {{organizationId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "alias": "Firma TEST",
  "p12Base64": "REPLACE_WITH_BASE64_OR_USE_MULTIPART",
  "password": "REPLACE_WITH_SECRET",
  "makeDefault": true
}


### 5) Validar firma
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/electronic-signatures/{{signatureId}}/validate
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Hermes-Organization-Id: {{organizationId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}


### 6) Activar firma
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/electronic-signatures/{{signatureId}}/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Hermes-Organization-Id: {{organizationId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}


### 7) Asegurar secuencia
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/electronic-sequences/ensure
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Hermes-Organization-Id: {{organizationId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "environment": "TEST",
  "documentType": "INVOICE",
  "establishmentCode": "001",
  "emissionPointCode": "001",
  "initialSequential": 1
}


### 8) Listar secuencias
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/electronic-sequences
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Hermes-Organization-Id: {{organizationId}}


### 9) Detalle de secuencia
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/electronic-sequences/{{sequenceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Hermes-Organization-Id: {{organizationId}}


### 10) Readiness final
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sri/settings/readiness
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Hermes-Organization-Id: {{organizationId}}


### 11) Emitir factura electrónica desde venta
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/electronic-invoices
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Hermes-Organization-Id: {{organizationId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "saleId": "{{saleId}}",
  "sendEmail": false
}


### 12) Listar facturas electrónicas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/electronic-invoices?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Hermes-Organization-Id: {{organizationId}}


### 13) Detalle factura electrónica
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/electronic-invoices/{{documentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Hermes-Organization-Id: {{organizationId}}


### 14) Errores SRI/Admin
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/electronic-invoices/{{documentId}}/errors
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Hermes-Organization-Id: {{organizationId}}


### 15) Reintentar autorización
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/electronic-invoices/{{documentId}}/retry-authorization
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Hermes-Organization-Id: {{organizationId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}


### 16) Generar/regenerar RIDE
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/electronic-invoices/{{documentId}}/ride
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Hermes-Organization-Id: {{organizationId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}


### 17) Descargar XML autorizado
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/electronic-invoices/{{documentId}}/authorized-xml
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Hermes-Organization-Id: {{organizationId}}


### 18) Descargar XML firmado
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/electronic-invoices/{{documentId}}/signed-xml
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Hermes-Organization-Id: {{organizationId}}


### 19) Descargar RIDE PDF
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/electronic-invoices/{{documentId}}/ride.pdf
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Hermes-Organization-Id: {{organizationId}}


### 20) Enviar email
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/electronic-invoices/{{documentId}}/email
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Hermes-Organization-Id: {{organizationId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "to": "cliente@example.com",
  "cc": [],
  "message": "Adjuntamos su comprobante electrónico."
}


### 21) Timeline
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/electronic-invoices/{{documentId}}/timeline
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Hermes-Organization-Id: {{organizationId}}


### 22) Homologation readiness
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/electronic-invoices/homologation/readiness
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Hermes-Organization-Id: {{organizationId}}


### 23) Run homologation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/electronic-invoices/homologation/run
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Hermes-Organization-Id: {{organizationId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestedScenarios": [
    "FINAL_CONSUMER_INVOICE",
    "IDENTIFIED_CUSTOMER_INVOICE",
    "IVA_INVOICE",
    "ZERO_RATE_INVOICE",
    "DISCOUNT_INVOICE",
    "MULTI_ITEM_INVOICE",
    "AUTHORIZATION_RETRY",
    "RIDE_GENERATION",
    "EMAIL_DELIVERY"
  ]
}


### 24) Listar runs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/electronic-invoices/homologation/runs
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Hermes-Organization-Id: {{organizationId}}


### 25) Detalle run
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/electronic-invoices/homologation/runs/{{homologationRunId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Hermes-Organization-Id: {{organizationId}}


### 26) Reporte run markdown
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/electronic-invoices/homologation/runs/{{homologationRunId}}/report.md
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Hermes-Organization-Id: {{organizationId}}


### 27) Gate producción — debe fallar si feature flag global está apagado
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sri/settings/enable-production
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Hermes-Organization-Id: {{organizationId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "confirmation": "ENABLE_SRI_PRODUCTION",
  "initialSequential": 1
}
